qtranslate (0.14.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release: text checking as a separate mode with the LanguageTool and AI providers.
  * Add the DuckDuckGo and LibreTranslate translation providers.
  * Remove the opt-in gates; every translation provider is available by default.
  * Move the OpenAI-compatible provider to its own AI tab and call it AI in the interface.
  * Fix the tray icon on Astra Linux.

